WEBVTT

00:20:59.483 --> 00:21:01.447
It's up to you guys to make them, right?

00:21:01.471 --> 00:21:02.734
CA: Exactly.

00:21:02.758 --> 00:21:03.916
Linus Torvalds,

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:06.185
thank you for Linux,
thank you for the Internet,

00:21:06.209 --> 00:21:08.074
thank you for all those Android phones.

00:21:08.098 --> 00:21:11.295
Thank you for coming here to TED
and revealing so much of yourself.

00:21:11.319 --> 00:21:12.471
LT: Thank you.

00:21:12.495 --> 00:21:16.935
(Applause)